description:
This is an adapter for Wiha SpeedE I & II electric screwdriver to use the 18650 battery, not only the 18500 battery. In order to have more mAh.

You DON'T need to modify the screwdriver.

Installation:
- After 3D printing the part you need to add the conductor wire of around (1 to 2 mm diameter) and  100mm length (see picture), it needs to steak out 3 mm to make contact with the lid;
- Remove the 18500 battery, align the holes in the adapter and the body of the screwdriver then screw the adapter;
- Make sore that the wire is in contact with the original pin;
-Screw the lid;

I have uploaded 2 models:
 "Wiha_SpeedE_18650_adapter_extramaterial" with extra material at the holes, in order to eliminate supports for that zone, you need to remove it after printing (see picture).
"Wiha_SpeedE_18650_adapter_NO_extramaterial" WITHOUT extra material, you need to add extra supports.

